{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53371","headline":"诗偈 五 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"事上说佛国，此去十万里。\n大海渺无边，动即黑风起。\n往者虽千万，达者无一二。\n忽遇本来人，不在阴阳里。\n（见日本《大正新修大藏经》第四八册吴越释延寿撰《万善同归集》卷上）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53371.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53371","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}